:: Mom Brushing Teeth [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1675,3025","size":"100,100"}
/* Shared bathroom, short and light: she is in a hurry and the sink is the only one. */
<<silent>>
<<set _rnd to either(0, 1, 2, 3, 4)>>
<<set _vid1 to _rnd + "_1">>
<</silent>>
<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/brushing teeth/" _vid1 ".webm">>
<p>I push the bathroom door open. $mom.callName is at the sink with a toothbrush in her mouth and one eye on the clock.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $mom, text: "Mmf. Hey, sweethar. Mm-mm mm mmnute, I'm running late." },
	{ who: $player, text: "Sorry?" },
	{ who: $mom, text: "(spits) I said give me one minute. I'm running late." }
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<div id="choice1">
	<div>
		<<link "Squeeze in next to her and brush too">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ text: "I grab my toothbrush and wedge myself in beside her. We bump hips at the sink and both start laughing through the foam." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Hey, you're taking up the whole mirror, I can't even see what I'm doing!" },
					{ who: $player, text: "You've done this every morning for twenty years. You could do it with your eyes closed." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Well, apparently I'll have to, now that my own $mom.playerRelation is hogging the sink." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<br>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 2>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Wait in the hallway">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ text: "I step back and pull the door almost closed. She finishes in a rush and comes out with her hair still half done." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Thanks for waiting, honey." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Ask if she needs anything from the store">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Do you need anything from the store? I'm heading out later." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Oh, coffee, and bread if they still have the good kind. Have you seen what coffee costs now? I honestly don't know how anyone can still afford to be awake." },
					{ who: $player, text: "Sure, I'll grab both." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Keep the receipt, okay? I don't want you spending your own money on us." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
